### Home Application Fix API — smoke tests (REST Client / VS Code)
@base = http://localhost:4000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "User One"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Modules catalog
GET {{base}}/api/modules

### Google (dev idToken — payload only)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

